TEXT 48 48 Left 2 ;10 kW (2x5kW) Microgrid Boost FB-LLC — 45 kHz SOT-227 + Busbar + TDK U93/76/30 (6:13:13, +/-200V Split Bus)
TEXT 48 560 Left 2 !.param fsw=45.0k
TEXT 48 592 Left 2 !.tran 0 7m 5m 25n uic
TEXT 48 624 Left 2 !K_T1 Lp1 Ls1_top Ls1_bot 0.999
TEXT 48 656 Left 2 !.model MYSW SW(Ron=5.5m Roff=1Meg Vt=5 Vh=0.5)
TEXT 48 688 Left 2 !.model SIC650 D(Vfwd=1.3 Ron=10m Roff=10Meg)
TEXT 560 560 Left 2 ;Notes:
TEXT 560 592 Left 2 ;- Ls1_top = Ls1_bot = Lm * (13/6)^2 = 12.5u * 4.6944 = 58.68 uH (TDK U93/76/30)
TEXT 560 624 Left 2 ;- C_top/C_bot set to 200uF (IC=200V) for fast sim settling (hardware bank = 60mF/rail)
TEXT 560 656 Left 2 ;- Test asymmetric 120VAC load by changing R_load_neg to 10k while R_load_pos=16 (2.5kW on +200V only!)
TEXT 560 688 Left 2 ;- Wire V_DRV_A to S_Q1/S_Q4 control pins and V_DRV_B to S_Q2/S_Q3 control pins in LTspice UI if adjusting gate drive
